  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 103.29 “Maximum contaminant level goal (MCLG)” means “maximum contaminant level goal” as defined in RSA 485:1-a,VIII, as reprinted in Appendix B. Maximum contaminant level goals are non-enforceable health goals.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14",
